                <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n\n    actor Employee\n    participant UI as React\n    participant CF as Cloudflare\n    participant ALB as AWS ALB\n    participant API as FastAPI\n    participant LG as LangGraph\n    participant CP as PostgreSQL Checkpointer\n    participant RAG as Hybrid RAG&lt;br/&gt;FTS + pgvector + RRF\n    participant RR as Reranker\n    participant GW as Model Gateway\n    participant OAI as OpenAI\n    actor Reviewer\n    participant DB as Business PostgreSQL\n\n    Employee-&gt;&gt;UI: Submit expense\n    UI-&gt;&gt;CF: HTTPS\n    CF-&gt;&gt;ALB: Forward request\n    ALB-&gt;&gt;API: POST /expenses\n\n    API-&gt;&gt;DB: Create expense\n    API-&gt;&gt;LG: Start workflow(thread_id)\n    LG-&gt;&gt;CP: Save state\n\n    LG-&gt;&gt;RAG: Retrieve active policy\n    RAG--&gt;&gt;LG: Candidate chunks\n    LG-&gt;&gt;RR: Rerank evidence\n    RR--&gt;&gt;LG: Top 3-5 chunks\n\n    LG-&gt;&gt;GW: Interpret policy\n    GW-&gt;&gt;OAI: Structured LLM request\n    OAI--&gt;&gt;GW: Policy rule + citations\n    GW--&gt;&gt;LG: Validated result\n\n    LG-&gt;&gt;LG: Deterministic rule check&lt;br/&gt;+ citation validation\n\n    alt COMPLIANT / NON_COMPLIANT\n        LG-&gt;&gt;DB: Save final assessment\n        LG--&gt;&gt;API: Final decision\n        API--&gt;&gt;UI: Decision + citation\n\n    else NEEDS_REVIEW\n        LG-&gt;&gt;DB: Save exception\n        LG-&gt;&gt;CP: Persist HITL state\n        LG-&gt;&gt;LG: interrupt()\n\n        Reviewer-&gt;&gt;UI: Review exception\n        UI-&gt;&gt;API: Submit decision\n        API-&gt;&gt;DB: Save reviewer action\n        API-&gt;&gt;LG: Resume workflow\n        LG-&gt;&gt;CP: Load checkpoint\n\n        LG-&gt;&gt;DB: Finalize decision + audit\n        LG--&gt;&gt;API: Final outcome\n        API--&gt;&gt;UI: Approved / Rejected\n    end&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="2QG92wHA4my8CF1m5deV-1">
